cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "HiMoDiT: Hierarchical Molecular Diffusion Transformer"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-28
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/TODO/himodit"
abstract: >-
  A property-conditioned generative model for drug-like molecules built as
  a four-stage cascade over a chemically structured latent space: ring
  layout, branch topology, atom identity, and terminal decoration. The bond
  matrix between stages is constructed by a deterministic decoder rather
  than sampled, so every generated scaffold is a valid ring system by
  construction.
keywords:
  - molecular generation
  - discrete diffusion
  - cheminformatics
  - drug discovery

